    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; width: 97%"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Does not include proceeds from the exercise of the Warrants issued to investors in connection with a concurrent private placement, which Warrants and underlying shares are not offered by this prospectus or registered in the underlying registration statement.</FONT></TD></TR>
