of the total expenses, excluding underwriting discounts and commissions, that we expect to incur in connection with this offering. With
the exception of the SEC registration fee, all amounts are estimates.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

